OL,3,GNEWSANew sighting of missing Lillia, 13
OL,4,
OL,5,FPolice have received fresh CCTV of a
OL,6,Fgirl who has been missing from home for
OL,7,Fa week.
OL,9,FLillia, 13, from Bolton, was last seen
OL,10,Fby her family last Friday, but was seen
OL,11,Flater that evening in Manchester's
OL,12,FPicadilly bus station, and at the
OL,13,FTrafford Centre the following day.
OL,15,FOfficers who have been handing out
OL,16,Fhundreds of leaflets to try to locate
OL,17,FLillia have now released new footage of
OL,18,Fher at a McDonald's restaurant in
OL,19,FPiccadilly from Sunday at about 20:20
OL,20,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
